# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Luma — Code Owners
#
# Auto-requests review from the listed owners when matching files
# change. Last matching pattern wins, so the catch-all default is
# first and the more specific rules follow.
#
# Enforced as a merge gate only when the `main` ruleset has
# "Require review from Code Owners" enabled. While the project has a
# single maintainer, keep that setting OFF: GitHub does not let a PR
# author approve their own PR, so a lone required code owner would
# deadlock every self-opened PR. This file still auto-requests review
# and documents ownership, and is ready for collaborators or teams.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

